 adopt to new way of configuring BYOK models\n* #2887: We don't need this extra prompt anymore\n* #2880: chatLib: fix: register completions fetch service for chatLib\n* #2694: ghost: use CompletionsFetchService\n* #2874: ghost: fix: destroying http connection didn't work because promise was not awaited\n* #2873: Clone diagnostics before sorting\n* #2849: Add support for diagnostics in completions prompt\n* #2736: Search Subagent support\n* #2872: Include the summary as attachment reference into new BG Chat\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=392777&view=logs).</details>"}}